OL,3,GNEWSAChurch renovations leave modellers
OL,4,Ahomeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FA model railway club says it faces an
OL,7,Funcertain future after being told to
OL,8,Fmove out of a church as the building
OL,9,Fprepares to close for renovations.
OL,11,FHessle Model Railway Club must vacate
OL,12,FTower Hill Methodist Church by 30
OL,13,FOctober, forcing members to search for
OL,14,Fa new venue.
OL,16,FClub secretary Ian Rumford said: "If we
OL,17,Fcan't find somewhere to go, a bit of
OL,18,Flocal history is going to disappear."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
