OL,3,GNEWSAChurch renovations leave modellers
OL,4,Ahomeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church spokesperson said: "The
OL,7,Fmaintenance works are urgently required
OL,8,Fand, given the scale of the works being
OL,9,Fundertaken, we cannot confidently say
OL,10,Fwhen the church will re-open."
